  "description": "Shy and reserved Lee-Won has admired the charismatic Seo Han-Gun for years, but their unexpected friendship blossoms into first love during middle school. Torn apart by reality, they lose touch for eight years—until a chance reunion in Busan forces them to confront old wounds and lingering feelings. Can love overcome the pain of the past?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
